---
title: Holiday Eggnog Salad
author: Judy White
category: Salads
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@lemon Jell-O{1%small}
@boiling water{1%cup}
@cold water{1/4%c}
@eggnog{3/4%c}
@cherry Jell-O{1%small}
@boiling water{1%cup}
@cold water or juice{3/4%c} (from small can of pears and mandarin oranges)
@pears (diced)
@mandarin oranges

Dissolve lemon Jell-O in 1 cup boiling water. Add 1/4 cup cold water and eggnog. Mix and chill about 25-30 minutes until starting to set.

Separately mix: Dissolve cherry Jell-O in 1 cup boiling water. Add 3/4 cup cold water or juice from small can of pears and mandarin oranges. Dice pears and add to cherry Jell-O mixture. Pour over eggnog mixture and chill until starting to set then add mandarin oranges to the top.
